; XAUUSD_M1_LiquidityZeroCross_Bearish v1.20 - M3 trigger / H4 bias / 12:00-16:30 server time
; From the every-timeframe search (39 trigger/filter pairs). Chosen with 2025 data ONLY (median of the setup and its neighbouring settings, >=30 trades per half-year); 2026 is out of sample.
; Backtest: 106 trades, PF 2.07, net +16.1R, max DD 2.3R; PF 1.77 / 2.33 (2025) / 2.15 on 26 trades (2026, out of sample). Worst-case trailing fills PF 1.42.
; When no liquidity pool pays MinRewardRisk, TP is a fixed 1.5R (TP_FallbackRR=1.5).
; Session hours are BROKER SERVER TIME (TradingHoursAreGMT=false). They were calibrated on FTMO data whose clock is GMT+2 winter / GMT+3 summer (New York close).
; UseNewsFilter=true was NOT part of the backtest (no calendar history); live trade count and results will differ. Set it to false to match the backtest exactly.
; Points are 2-digit gold units scaled by sqrt(3) for M3 (AutoScalePoints handles 3-digit feeds).
